{"words": [{"text": "۞ وَلَقَدْ", "translation": "And indeed"}, {"text": "جَآءَكُم", "translation": "came to you"}, {"text": "مُّوسَىٰ", "translation": "Musa"}, {"text": "بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ", "translation": "with [the] clear signs"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "ٱتَّخَذْتُمُ", "translation": "you took"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِجْلَ", "translation": "the calf"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِهِۦ", "translation": "after him"}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translation": "and you"}, {"text": "ظَـٰلِمُونَ", "translation": "(were) wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "And Moses had certainly brought you clear proofs. Then you took the calf [in worship] after that, while you were wrongdoers."}